WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:08.290
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:08.560 --> 03:10.200
I came here to give you the money.

3
03:10.280 --> 03:12.840
I had no idea Pong was going to show up.

4
03:12.920 --> 03:13.840
‎PREVIOUSLY

5
03:13.920 --> 03:16.240
If Grandpa won't give it to me, then I won't ask.

6
03:16.320 --> 03:17.760
I'll steal it.

7
03:17.840 --> 03:19.000
-Grandpa. -Father.

8
03:19.080 --> 03:20.800
-Grandpa… -Try to stay calm.

9
03:23.520 --> 03:24.960
For you and Raiwin.

10
03:25.040 --> 03:26.400
I'm not asking for much.

11
03:26.480 --> 03:28.520
Just don't betray me or be ungrateful.

12
03:31.360 --> 03:32.800
I'm tired.

13
03:40.360 --> 03:41.880
Massage my feet.

14
03:46.280 --> 03:48.720
Don't you think you should repay me somehow?

15
04:03.320 --> 04:04.560
Massage them.

16
04:28.040 --> 04:29.120
Do you know

17
04:30.720 --> 04:33.560
why I don't keep dogs or cats?

18
04:41.240 --> 04:42.600
Because I'm afraid

19
04:43.920 --> 04:46.160
that if I keep pets,

20
04:46.800 --> 04:48.320
they might not obey me.

21
04:51.800 --> 04:53.880
And if they won't obey me,

22
04:56.960 --> 04:59.160
I definitely won't keep them around.

23
05:03.200 --> 05:04.720
Keep massaging.

24
05:24.280 --> 05:27.680
Mom, have Hathaya and Ramil gone back to the house yet?

25
05:28.320 --> 05:29.720
I haven't seen them.

26
05:30.360 --> 05:32.840
They're probably still at the hospital with Grandpa.

27
05:32.920 --> 05:35.840
Hurry into Grandpa's room and put everything back the way it was.

28
05:35.920 --> 05:38.040
If they get home, they'll figure out

29
05:38.120 --> 05:39.440
I was there to steal the money

30
05:39.520 --> 05:41.680
and argued with Grandpa before he fell down.

31
05:43.080 --> 05:46.240
Ramil and Hathaya are back.

32
05:49.160 --> 05:50.160
Hey.

33
05:50.800 --> 05:51.720
Where are you going?

34
05:53.200 --> 05:54.840
I'm going to Grandpa's room.

35
05:55.640 --> 05:57.080
Grandpa is seriously ill.

36
05:57.160 --> 05:58.760
You should be with him.

37
05:59.360 --> 06:01.160
You claim you love him and then

38
06:01.240 --> 06:03.800
come running home because you want to be comfortable.

39
06:04.480 --> 06:05.960
They don't allow visitors now.

40
06:06.040 --> 06:08.280
I'll be going back soon.

41
06:08.880 --> 06:10.880
Then why waste time going back and forth?

42
06:11.560 --> 06:12.720
We have something to do.

43
06:13.640 --> 06:16.680
What could possibly be more important than Grandpa's life?

44
06:17.360 --> 06:18.840
Finding out the truth.

45
06:19.440 --> 06:21.560
We want to know how he fell down the stairs.

46
06:22.240 --> 06:25.080
We don't believe he left his room by himself.

47
06:28.920 --> 06:29.800
Let's go.

48
06:30.400 --> 06:33.400
I said… I said don't go. Come back.

49
06:33.480 --> 06:34.880
Hey, come back.

50
06:35.880 --> 06:37.520
You can't go in there. Get out.

51
06:44.920 --> 06:47.480
See? There's nothing here.

52
06:48.360 --> 06:49.320
Wait.

53
06:51.280 --> 06:52.840
What exactly are you two looking for?

54
06:55.240 --> 06:56.800
You disobeyed me.

55
06:56.880 --> 06:58.920
Get out. Get out of my house right now.

56
07:14.600 --> 07:15.720
Go.

57
07:15.800 --> 07:17.480
Pack your things

58
07:17.560 --> 07:19.800
and get out of my house right now.

59
07:19.880 --> 07:22.440
You don't have the right to throw Ramil and me out.

60
07:23.200 --> 07:24.400
That's right.

61
07:24.480 --> 07:26.760
Mr. Pichai gave us permission to live here.

62
07:27.360 --> 07:31.000
Your Mr. Pichai is seriously ill. He can't speak

63
07:31.080 --> 07:32.400
or do anything.

64
07:32.480 --> 07:35.320
As the daughter-in-law of this family,

65
07:35.400 --> 07:39.480
it's my responsibility to manage everything on Grandpa's behalf.

66
07:39.560 --> 07:41.040
So I have full authority

67
07:41.120 --> 07:43.520
to throw you two out. Go.

68
07:45.080 --> 07:46.400
Don't be so heartless, Mom.

69
07:51.440 --> 07:53.600
Hathaya loves Grandpa

70
07:53.680 --> 07:56.800
and has helped take care of him. Let her stay here.

71
07:57.480 --> 07:59.640
Don't let her stay, sweetheart. Throw her out.

72
08:00.280 --> 08:01.280
Mom.

73
08:02.040 --> 08:05.600
With Grandpa not staying here, the house already feels lonely.

74
08:06.200 --> 08:08.200
If we throw these two out too,

75
08:08.280 --> 08:11.080
the place will feel even more depressing.

76
08:15.680 --> 08:17.040
Well, you two can stay.

77
08:17.120 --> 08:19.720
But stay in that shabby little area of yours.

78
08:19.800 --> 08:21.640
Don't show your faces around us again.

79
08:22.680 --> 08:23.520
Go.

80
08:30.640 --> 08:31.720
Chayanee.

81
08:32.760 --> 08:33.880
What are you thinking?

82
08:33.960 --> 08:36.000
Why keep a thorn in our side?

83
08:36.080 --> 08:39.240
What if they turn around and stab us in the back?

84
08:40.000 --> 08:42.679
At first, I wanted them gone too.

85
08:43.960 --> 08:45.720
But then I thought about it.

86
08:46.480 --> 08:47.720
That wouldn't be satisfying.

87
08:50.200 --> 08:52.600
I'm going to keep them close

88
08:52.680 --> 08:54.960
and grind them into the dirt.

89
08:55.040 --> 08:56.920
I'll send them back to where they started.

90
08:59.880 --> 09:03.160
When they opened the door earlier,

91
09:03.240 --> 09:05.600
my heart almost stopped.

92
09:06.960 --> 09:09.400
Who did you send in to clean up Grandpa's room?

93
09:12.000 --> 09:13.280
I didn't send anyone.

94
09:13.360 --> 09:14.880
I only called you.

95
09:17.960 --> 09:19.080
Chamoi.

96
09:22.240 --> 09:24.680
I knew those two would come into Mr. Pichai's room.

97
09:25.320 --> 09:28.000
So I hurried in and cleaned everything up.

98
09:29.040 --> 09:30.560
What did you see before that?

99
09:32.400 --> 09:34.400
I was cleaning the prayer room.

100
09:34.480 --> 09:36.000
I heard shouting,

101
09:36.080 --> 09:38.360
so I came out…

102
09:38.440 --> 09:40.000
And what else did you see?

103
09:41.400 --> 09:42.760
I saw you

104
09:42.840 --> 09:46.040
push Mr. Pichai down the stairs.

105
09:52.920 --> 09:54.520
Shut your mouth.

106
09:54.600 --> 09:55.640
I didn't do that.

107
09:55.720 --> 09:57.240
I saw it with my own eyes.

108
09:57.320 --> 09:59.400
Mr. Pichai was trying to hold onto you,

109
09:59.480 --> 10:02.160
and then you pushed him away.

110
10:03.520 --> 10:04.720
Chamoi.

111
10:04.800 --> 10:06.120
You know too much.

112
10:06.800 --> 10:07.920
Chamoi.

113
10:08.000 --> 10:10.080
Keep your mouth shut.

114
10:10.160 --> 10:11.560
I'll give you 10,000.

115
10:11.640 --> 10:13.400
This is serious.

116
10:14.320 --> 10:15.560
I won't say anything.

117
10:16.400 --> 10:19.640
But Madam, this is a huge deal.

118
10:20.320 --> 10:22.240
Are you trying to blackmail me?

119
10:24.040 --> 10:27.680
If I saw something this serious and keep quiet,

120
10:27.760 --> 10:30.440
that makes me guilty too.

121
10:33.000 --> 10:34.600
I want one million.

122
10:34.680 --> 10:36.600
That's too much.

123
10:39.520 --> 10:41.000
It's not that much.

124
10:41.080 --> 10:42.600
I saw you

125
10:42.680 --> 10:45.520
take a lot of money from the safe.

126
10:45.600 --> 10:46.840
Just one million,

127
10:46.920 --> 10:49.920
and I promise I'll keep my mouth shut.

128
10:50.440 --> 10:53.440
I'll be as silent as the dead.

129
10:54.560 --> 10:56.080
Then die.

130
10:56.880 --> 10:57.720
Come here.

131
10:57.800 --> 10:59.080
Madam. Miss Chayanee.

132
10:59.160 --> 11:02.080
-Don't, sweetheart. Let her go. -Miss Chayanee.

133
11:02.160 --> 11:03.960
Don't.

134
11:04.040 --> 11:07.720
I'm not letting her go, Mom. If I let her go, she'll talk.

135
11:07.800 --> 11:09.480
And if she talks, I'll go to prison.

136
11:10.080 --> 11:10.920
Chayanee.

137
11:11.000 --> 11:12.880
Don't make this any worse than it already is.

138
11:12.960 --> 11:13.760
Let her go.

139
11:13.840 --> 11:15.240
Miss Chayanee. I promise…

140
11:15.320 --> 11:17.520
I won't say anything.

141
11:17.600 --> 11:19.080
I don't want the money anymore.

142
11:20.120 --> 11:21.680
-I don't want it. -Don't hurt her.

143
11:21.760 --> 11:23.440
-Let her go. -Please.

144
11:24.040 --> 11:25.600
Let me go.

145
11:33.600 --> 11:34.720
Chamoi.

146
11:34.800 --> 11:36.840
Listen to me.

147
11:37.520 --> 11:38.880
I'll give you the money.

148
11:39.560 --> 11:42.440
You have to stay here. I'll take care of you.

149
11:42.520 --> 11:46.040
No, madam.

150
11:46.120 --> 11:49.720
I don't want anything anymore. I don't want to die.

151
11:49.800 --> 11:51.520
Please let me leave.

152
11:51.600 --> 11:52.720
Chamoi.

153
11:53.320 --> 11:54.680
You have to stay here.

154
11:55.880 --> 11:57.360
You promised me.

155
11:58.000 --> 12:02.400
Madam, please help me.

156
12:03.040 --> 12:07.040
My mom is seriously ill.

157
12:07.120 --> 12:10.720
We don't have enough money to take her to the hospital.

158
12:11.440 --> 12:13.000
Please help me.

159
12:13.080 --> 12:15.840
I'll never forget this kindness.

160
12:15.920 --> 12:18.800
I'll work myself to the bone for you.

161
12:18.880 --> 12:21.800
Take your mom to the hospital right away.

162
12:21.880 --> 12:23.720
I'll pay for her treatment.

163
12:23.800 --> 12:25.600
Madam.

164
12:26.880 --> 12:30.880
I… I've never forgotten

165
12:30.960 --> 12:35.040
what you did for me. I've always remembered your kindness.

166
12:35.120 --> 12:36.400
That's why

167
12:38.080 --> 12:40.640
I've been willing to work for you,

168
12:41.640 --> 12:44.240
to be whatever you needed me to be.

169
12:46.360 --> 12:47.520
Miss Chayanee.

170
12:48.800 --> 12:52.680
I promise I won't say anything.

171
12:52.760 --> 12:56.480
I'll keep my mouth shut.

172
12:56.560 --> 13:00.600
Please don't kill me.

173
13:01.400 --> 13:02.880
Chayanee, sweetheart.

174
13:04.080 --> 13:05.920
You need to calm down.

175
13:06.560 --> 13:09.400
What happened to Grandpa is already serious enough.

176
13:10.920 --> 13:13.760
I don't want you creating another problem.

177
13:14.360 --> 13:16.680
Here's what we'll do.

178
13:17.360 --> 13:19.120
Only the three of us know about this.

179
13:19.200 --> 13:21.640
It ends here. Alright?

180
13:23.120 --> 13:26.000
Grandpa is still in the hospital.

181
13:26.080 --> 13:28.240
What are you going to do next?

182
13:29.360 --> 13:30.920
This is our opportunity.

183
13:31.640 --> 13:33.840
We need to take control of everything.

184
13:43.320 --> 13:44.760
Everyone already knows

185
13:44.840 --> 13:48.680
that my grandfather is seriously ill and will need a long period of treatment.

186
13:49.280 --> 13:51.880
I'll be taking over management.

187
13:54.240 --> 13:56.520
And here's management's first order.

188
13:57.200 --> 13:58.360
Hathaya.

189
13:59.120 --> 14:01.520
Pack your things and get out of the office.

190
14:02.600 --> 14:05.120
Grandpa put me in charge of the project's accounts.

191
14:05.960 --> 14:08.560
I can't follow that order.

192
14:09.280 --> 14:12.160
Maybe I need to refresh everyone's memory.

193
14:12.760 --> 14:15.000
The company president is currently ill.

194
14:15.680 --> 14:17.880
As vice president,

195
14:18.640 --> 14:20.120
I'm taking over management.

196
14:20.840 --> 14:23.280
So management's orders

197
14:23.360 --> 14:24.800
are final.

198
14:26.040 --> 14:28.440
I'll handle all accounting and finances myself.

199
14:28.520 --> 14:30.160
And I'm ordering a full audit.

200
14:31.440 --> 14:33.600
Your mother already stole money from us.

201
14:34.200 --> 14:35.600
Maybe you embezzled some too.

202
14:36.760 --> 14:39.760
If I find evidence, you can get ready for prison.

203
14:42.200 --> 14:44.160
Then what do you want me to help with?

204
14:44.240 --> 14:45.760
Marketing?

205
14:47.240 --> 14:49.000
You're talented.

206
14:49.840 --> 14:52.560
Put you in marketing, and you'd sell every single house.

207
14:53.280 --> 14:56.320
That would be too easy.

208
14:57.840 --> 14:59.600
Then what do you want me to do?

209
15:01.320 --> 15:03.280
Go back to the construction site.

210
15:04.800 --> 15:06.480
Back to where you started.

211
15:09.240 --> 15:10.920
You do this to humiliate her.

212
15:12.520 --> 15:14.120
You're moving her from accounting

213
15:15.240 --> 15:16.360
just to send her

214
15:17.240 --> 15:18.960
back to manual labor?

215
15:21.320 --> 15:22.520
Ramil.

216
15:23.400 --> 15:25.440
I'm showing my sister a great deal of respect.

217
15:26.200 --> 15:27.440
If I meant to humiliate her,

218
15:28.040 --> 15:29.800
I'd send her to housekeeping

219
15:29.880 --> 15:33.040
to scrub toilets.

220
15:35.560 --> 15:37.520
Why am I sending her to the construction site?

221
15:38.680 --> 15:41.240
Because Hathaya is so beloved by the workers.

222
15:42.280 --> 15:45.760
She's their angel. Their beloved champion of the low-class masses.

223
15:46.600 --> 15:49.080
If she works construction herself,

224
15:49.800 --> 15:53.200
I think our development will be finished in no time.

225
15:56.120 --> 15:57.800
I'll wrap up the accounting today.

226
15:58.480 --> 16:00.200
I'll start at the site tomorrow.

227
16:04.400 --> 16:05.440
No.

228
16:06.320 --> 16:09.680
You're starting today. Right now.

229
16:10.280 --> 16:11.360
Chamoi.

230
16:12.200 --> 16:13.600
Yes, madam.

231
16:21.600 --> 16:24.840
There's your low-level worker uniform.

232
16:33.880 --> 16:34.920
Go on.

233
16:35.800 --> 16:37.480
Get to work.

234
16:38.080 --> 16:40.840
And don't disappoint your new president.

235
16:41.520 --> 16:44.120
Go. Everyone, back to work.

236
17:06.560 --> 17:07.560
They're awful.

237
17:08.440 --> 17:09.680
They didn't fire you

238
17:10.800 --> 17:13.960
only because they want to pressure you and get revenge.

239
17:15.280 --> 17:18.640
The more they see that Grandpa loves and trusts me,

240
17:19.280 --> 17:21.000
the more they want to grind me down.

241
17:21.880 --> 17:24.640
Can you handle this? You don't have to put up with it.

242
17:25.280 --> 17:26.480
I'm not giving up.

243
17:27.319 --> 17:31.560
Grandpa is sick. I have to stay and take care of his business as best I can.

244
17:34.880 --> 17:37.360
I'm glad you're fighting.

245
17:38.600 --> 17:39.760
Then…

246
17:40.360 --> 17:41.960
I'll fight with you.

247
17:53.480 --> 17:54.720
I'm going to work.

248
18:05.320 --> 18:09.200
You see your older brother and you can't be bothered to say hello or show respect?

249
18:11.800 --> 18:13.120
I already told you.

250
18:14.000 --> 18:15.680
When I look at you,

251
18:17.120 --> 18:18.600
all I see is a mask

252
18:19.520 --> 18:21.320
with your father's face on it.

253
18:22.480 --> 18:24.720
You're not the Raiwin I used to know anymore.

254
18:42.920 --> 18:45.480
Congratulations to the new president.

255
18:47.280 --> 18:49.080
Thank you.

256
18:55.080 --> 18:58.760
When I came in just now, I saw your sister wearing a worker's uniform.

257
19:00.880 --> 19:03.480
I sent her somewhere she likes.

258
19:04.320 --> 19:07.080
Why? Do you feel sorry for her?

259
19:07.160 --> 19:09.160
Or do you want to go back for someone low-class?

260
19:11.640 --> 19:12.720
Hey.

261
19:13.480 --> 19:16.640
I'm smart enough to know who's good for me.

262
19:19.200 --> 19:22.400
With a mouth that sweet, what are you trying to get from me?

263
19:23.000 --> 19:24.400
Can you help me with something?

264
19:25.600 --> 19:28.320
I hate people who look down on me and act like I don't matter.

265
19:29.440 --> 19:31.080
Who do you mean?

266
19:35.760 --> 19:37.440
Miss Hathaya. Don't carry that.

267
19:38.880 --> 19:40.840
-It's fine. I can do it. -No.

268
19:40.920 --> 19:42.320
No. It's heavy.

269
19:42.400 --> 19:44.240
Max, I've done this before.

270
19:44.320 --> 19:47.000
My beautiful little Hathaya.

271
19:47.080 --> 19:48.640
Go sit over there and look pretty.

272
19:48.720 --> 19:51.040
-Exactly. -Come on.

273
19:51.120 --> 19:52.880
-You don't have to do this. -Right.

274
19:52.960 --> 19:54.560
We'll handle this part.

275
19:56.280 --> 19:59.560
It's my job. The president ordered me to do it, so I have to do it.

276
20:02.880 --> 20:04.760
Boss. Come help.

277
20:04.840 --> 20:07.400
I'm not letting Miss Hathaya do heavy work like this.

278
20:08.040 --> 20:11.040
Then why don't you supervise the workers over there?

279
20:11.120 --> 20:14.200
-But if-- -I'm the foreman.

280
20:14.280 --> 20:15.920
You have to follow my orders.

281
20:17.360 --> 20:20.960
If Chayanee finds out, she won't be happy.

282
20:22.160 --> 20:24.480
Then when she comes,

283
20:24.560 --> 20:26.920
we'll put on the show she wants to see. Okay?

284
20:27.000 --> 20:30.520
We'll stand guard and warn you.

285
20:31.800 --> 20:34.360
-Okay. -Go. Go rest.

286
20:34.440 --> 20:37.560
Hey! The demon president is coming. Everyone, back to work.

287
20:37.640 --> 20:38.480
Go, go.

288
20:39.520 --> 20:41.720
Hurry.

289
20:42.840 --> 20:46.560
Well, Miss Chayanee, what's up?

290
20:47.160 --> 20:48.240
What brings you to the site?

291
20:48.880 --> 20:50.920
You almost never come here.

292
20:51.640 --> 20:53.600
I don't want to be here.

293
20:53.680 --> 20:56.760
It smells like sweat. And it smells like

294
20:57.400 --> 20:59.120
mud and buffalo.

295
20:59.200 --> 21:01.840
You've raised buffalo before, Miss Chayanee?

296
21:01.920 --> 21:05.200
Is that how you know what mud and buffalo smell like?

297
21:05.920 --> 21:07.240
Of course, I've smelled it.

298
21:07.840 --> 21:10.000
I'm raising some right now.

299
21:10.080 --> 21:11.360
A herd of cows and buffaloes.

300
21:11.440 --> 21:13.840
-Hey. -Hey.

301
21:13.920 --> 21:14.960
Miss Chayanee.

302
21:15.040 --> 21:17.840
When you say cows and buffaloes,

303
21:17.920 --> 21:20.040
you don't mean us, do you?

304
21:20.120 --> 21:22.280
Because none of us have horns.

305
21:23.680 --> 21:24.920
And nobody

306
21:25.000 --> 21:27.960
leads us around by the nose either.

307
21:30.640 --> 21:32.200
What did you come here for?

308
21:33.840 --> 21:35.440
We're working.

309
21:36.120 --> 21:37.480
If you stay in the way,

310
21:38.440 --> 21:39.520
things will slow down.

311
21:42.000 --> 21:43.360
Stop working.

312
21:45.880 --> 21:47.480
Which section should I work on then?

313
21:47.560 --> 21:49.240
None of them.

314
21:50.560 --> 21:51.520
You're fired.

315
21:54.080 --> 21:55.200
You're firing me?

316
21:56.600 --> 21:57.960
What did I do wrong?

317
21:58.560 --> 21:59.800
You didn't do anything wrong.

318
22:00.840 --> 22:02.440
I can't stand your face.

319
22:02.520 --> 22:05.680
I don't want to see you, and I don't want to work with you.

320
22:05.760 --> 22:07.040
Take the envelope and leave.

321
22:10.640 --> 22:12.080
Chayanee.

322
22:12.160 --> 22:13.560
If you're going to fire someone,

323
22:13.640 --> 22:15.520
you need a reason.

324
22:15.600 --> 22:17.360
You can't just act on your emotions.

325
22:17.960 --> 22:20.080
Workers are protected by labor law.

326
22:20.160 --> 22:22.800
If you do this, you could be sued.

327
22:22.880 --> 22:23.920
Then sue me.

328
22:24.560 --> 22:26.960
Go ahead. I have enough money to pay.

329
22:27.560 --> 22:28.480
Ramil.

330
22:29.000 --> 22:32.640
Let me give you some brotherly advice, since we used to share a roof.

331
22:33.320 --> 22:34.640
Just leave.

332
22:35.240 --> 22:37.760
Your boss doesn't want you here. Why stay?

333
22:39.280 --> 22:42.920
I guarantee Chayanee will pay you enough compensation.

334
22:43.880 --> 22:45.560
I've worked to the best of my ability.

335
22:46.800 --> 22:48.200
I'm not leaving.

336
22:49.000 --> 22:52.120
Fine. If you won't leave, then don't.

337
22:54.120 --> 22:55.400
I'm firing all of you.

338
22:56.080 --> 22:57.280
Huh?

339
22:57.960 --> 22:59.080
Why are you doing this?

340
22:59.800 --> 23:01.080
They've done nothing wrong.

341
23:03.000 --> 23:04.080
Then leave.

342
23:05.400 --> 23:07.200
And I'll keep the workers.

343
23:10.320 --> 23:12.360
Go. Get out.

344
23:13.000 --> 23:15.920
Those of you who used to wander the streets can go back to wandering.

345
23:16.000 --> 23:17.080
Go sell garbage.

346
23:17.160 --> 23:19.000
And all the migrant workers

347
23:19.080 --> 23:20.760
can return to your countries.

348
23:20.840 --> 23:22.920
If any of you wants to sue me,

349
23:23.000 --> 23:24.360
go ahead.

350
23:27.080 --> 23:28.280
But I'm warning you.

351
23:28.960 --> 23:31.360
Lawsuits don't end quickly.

352
23:32.640 --> 23:34.080
They can drag on for a long time.

353
23:34.880 --> 23:37.040
Where will you get money for a lawyer?

354
23:37.600 --> 23:38.680
Let alone to get by.

355
23:41.680 --> 23:44.920
Go. I fired you. Get out.

356
23:52.040 --> 23:54.040
Pack your things and get out.

357
23:54.720 --> 23:55.680
Go.

358
24:01.640 --> 24:02.600
I'll leave.

359
24:06.200 --> 24:08.120
You should've agreed from the beginning.

360
24:08.800 --> 24:12.600
Look at the workers. They're so scared, they're about to wet themselves.

361
24:24.080 --> 24:26.000
Take the envelope and leave.

362
24:26.680 --> 24:28.320
Don't linger where she has to see you.

363
24:40.480 --> 24:42.600
-Boss. -Boss.

364
24:54.400 --> 24:56.080
Are you sure you want to quit?

365
24:58.320 --> 25:00.960
It's the only way to save the workers.

366
25:03.200 --> 25:05.560
Chayanee is pressuring us from every direction.

367
25:09.080 --> 25:12.080
I can't even imagine what she'll do next.

368
25:14.320 --> 25:15.680
But no matter what happens,

369
25:16.800 --> 25:18.160
you have to stay here.

370
25:19.040 --> 25:20.240
The workers need you.

371
25:22.760 --> 25:23.920
I'll take care of them.

372
25:31.160 --> 25:32.240
Don't just stand there.

373
25:33.280 --> 25:36.880
Do I need to whip you before you'll move and get back to work?

374
25:39.040 --> 25:40.360
Still staring at me?

375
25:40.440 --> 25:42.720
Keep moving, or I won't pay you anything.

376
25:44.880 --> 25:46.320
Go back to the office.

377
25:47.280 --> 25:48.640
Don't stay and get upset.

378
25:50.120 --> 25:51.160
Good idea.

379
25:51.240 --> 25:55.560
I'd rather sit somewhere with AC. It reeks of mud and buffalo here.

380
26:00.760 --> 26:02.160
I quit.

381
26:02.240 --> 26:03.960
I quit too.

382
26:04.040 --> 26:05.200
I quit too.

383
26:05.280 --> 26:07.160
-We quit too. -We're quitting.

384
26:07.240 --> 26:08.760
We all quit.

385
26:08.840 --> 26:10.040
Think carefully.

386
26:10.760 --> 26:14.000
If you quit, what are you going to do for a living?

387
26:16.200 --> 26:17.480
We'll find new jobs.

388
26:18.680 --> 26:20.360
We won't work for a power-hungry boss.

389
26:21.320 --> 26:22.560
We're human beings.

390
26:23.160 --> 26:24.720
We're not buffaloes!

391
26:26.000 --> 26:28.000
-Come on, everyone. -Let's go.

392
26:28.080 --> 26:29.920
-Let's go. -We're leaving.

393
26:33.040 --> 26:34.120
Fine. Go.

394
26:35.680 --> 26:37.280
Chayanee.

395
26:37.800 --> 26:39.560
If you drive all the workers away,

396
26:40.080 --> 26:41.320
who's going to work for us?

397
26:41.400 --> 26:43.120
I'll hire new ones.

398
26:43.200 --> 26:44.800
I'm never begging them to come back.

399
26:44.880 --> 26:47.360
Good workers aren't easy to find.

400
26:47.880 --> 26:50.680
They've been here a long time. The project is almost finished.

401
26:51.280 --> 26:53.880
Why not wait until the work is done before firing them?

402
26:54.520 --> 26:55.760
What do you expect me to do?

403
26:56.720 --> 26:58.840
I am not lowering myself and begging them.

404
27:04.640 --> 27:06.680
I'll handle this.

405
27:15.560 --> 27:17.360
Quitting was the right thing to do.

406
27:17.440 --> 27:18.640
Boss.

407
27:19.240 --> 27:21.240
-Come on. -Boss.

408
27:26.720 --> 27:29.040
Wherever you're going, we're going too.

409
27:29.920 --> 27:32.360
Going where? Why aren't you working?

410
27:32.440 --> 27:34.920
-We quit. -What?

411
27:35.000 --> 27:37.520
We may be poor, but we still have dignity.

412
27:38.560 --> 27:41.880
Exactly. We can handle hard work.

413
27:42.760 --> 27:46.600
But I won't tolerate being abused

414
27:47.920 --> 27:49.000
and oppressed like that.

415
27:49.840 --> 27:51.400
-Yes. We're not buffaloes. -Yeah.

416
27:51.480 --> 27:53.800
-Exactly. -We're not buffaloes.

417
27:54.400 --> 27:57.200
Hathaya, you don't need to put up with it either.

418
27:58.560 --> 27:59.920
Let's work somewhere else.

419
28:01.000 --> 28:02.400
Exactly.

420
28:02.480 --> 28:03.760
All of us.

421
28:03.840 --> 28:06.120
Ramil. Hathaya.

422
28:06.200 --> 28:09.200
We're good at what we do. There are plenty of places that would hire us.

423
28:11.680 --> 28:13.000
I can't go.

424
28:14.440 --> 28:15.560
I'm staying here.

425
28:17.000 --> 28:20.520
Chayanee is deliberately oppressing you.

426
28:20.600 --> 28:22.280
She sent you here from accounting.

427
28:22.360 --> 28:23.840
She'll only treat you worse.

428
28:25.120 --> 28:26.120
Hathaya.

429
28:26.200 --> 28:29.280
Don't stay here serving these heartless rich people.

430
28:29.360 --> 28:30.720
I have to stay.

431
28:32.000 --> 28:33.440
I can't abandon this place.

432
28:39.760 --> 28:43.360
And I need to ask all of you to stay and help me.

433
28:50.080 --> 28:52.600
You all know how much Grandpa loves this development.

434
28:54.040 --> 28:56.200
I promised him

435
28:56.280 --> 28:58.560
I would take the best possible care of it.

436
28:59.960 --> 29:01.280
Now Grandpa is sick.

437
29:02.840 --> 29:04.840
We don't know when he'll wake up or recover.

438
29:06.920 --> 29:09.000
I'm going to keep this project going.

439
29:14.560 --> 29:16.000
If you love Grandpa

440
29:16.840 --> 29:20.160
and you want him to wake up and see his project completed…

441
29:23.920 --> 29:25.440
will you stay with me?

442
29:31.120 --> 29:32.320
Everyone.

443
29:33.560 --> 29:34.840
Do it for Mr. Pichai.

444
29:36.400 --> 29:37.640
The man who gave us a chance.

445
29:40.000 --> 29:41.280
Everyone.

446
29:46.280 --> 29:47.760
Listen to me.

447
29:48.880 --> 29:52.920
Chayanee didn't really mean to insult or fire all of you.

448
29:53.000 --> 29:54.520
So,

449
29:55.320 --> 29:57.280
I'll apologize on her behalf.

450
29:59.520 --> 30:01.640
I want all of you to go back to work now.

451
30:01.720 --> 30:03.120
Finish the project.

452
30:03.800 --> 30:06.840
I'll make sure everyone can work happily

453
30:07.520 --> 30:10.240
and there won't be any more problems. Okay?

454
30:14.040 --> 30:15.520
Look at them.

455
30:15.600 --> 30:18.600
They're so arrogant. Don't beg them.

456
30:18.680 --> 30:20.400
Let's hire new workers.

457
30:28.640 --> 30:31.320
We're going back to work. Why are you standing in our way?

458
30:36.400 --> 30:38.960
But understand this. We're not going back

459
30:39.040 --> 30:41.680
because of you two. We're doing it

460
30:41.760 --> 30:43.080
for Mr. Pichai,

461
30:43.160 --> 30:44.800
Ramil, and Hathaya.

462
30:49.640 --> 30:52.080
Come on, everyone. Let's get back to work.

463
31:04.160 --> 31:05.600
Let's go back to the office.

464
31:06.680 --> 31:10.040
You go ahead. I have something to settle with my younger brother.

465
31:20.280 --> 31:24.480
Aren't you wondering why Chayanee fired you

466
31:24.560 --> 31:26.040
when you do so much around here?

467
31:33.440 --> 31:34.800
So this was your doing?

468
31:36.880 --> 31:38.040
What do you want?

469
31:40.520 --> 31:43.800
I'm just teaching you to know your place.

470
31:45.440 --> 31:47.240
You grew up eating and living in my house.

471
31:48.000 --> 31:49.640
You should know how to please me.

472
31:52.120 --> 31:54.480
Don't act like you're above me.

473
31:55.320 --> 31:57.000
You've really changed

474
31:58.240 --> 31:59.680
since becoming subdistrict chief.

475
32:01.000 --> 32:04.400
You're just as power-hungry as your father now.

476
32:05.400 --> 32:07.880
Good. At least you understand that I have power.

477
32:08.960 --> 32:11.840
But you don't have to kneel and beg. I'm not that dramatic.

478
32:13.320 --> 32:15.480
Put your hands together and pay your respects

479
32:15.560 --> 32:17.120
and apologize for looking down on me.

480
32:18.240 --> 32:20.960
Then I'll let you come back to work.

481
32:31.960 --> 32:32.880
The hand…

482
32:35.440 --> 32:37.080
is important.

483
32:38.000 --> 32:39.680
It can mean a lot of things.

484
32:40.400 --> 32:42.760
If we put our palms together,

485
32:43.840 --> 32:45.840
it's like two decent people meeting

486
32:46.520 --> 32:50.600
and showing mutual respect.

487
32:53.080 --> 32:55.080
But if we

488
32:55.680 --> 32:56.840
close it like this,

489
32:58.560 --> 33:02.160
it's something we can use to defend ourselves

490
33:05.440 --> 33:07.080
or fight an enemy.

491
33:14.480 --> 33:17.800
You're the one who chose to make a fist and declare yourself my enemy.

492
33:19.080 --> 33:21.200
So get ready for what's coming.

493
33:22.600 --> 33:24.120
Make sure your mom survives it too.

494
33:49.160 --> 33:50.320
How are you, son?

495
33:50.400 --> 33:53.200
Raiwin said you're living with Hathaya now.

496
33:53.280 --> 33:55.120
That's good. You can take care of each other.

497
34:02.360 --> 34:03.640
Mom.

498
34:04.240 --> 34:05.160
Where's your wedding ring?

499
34:07.080 --> 34:10.760
I was careless. I wore it while washing dishes and it slipped down the drain.

500
34:11.719 --> 34:12.760
Did you lose it…

501
34:14.239 --> 34:15.560
or did someone make you sell it?

502
34:17.719 --> 34:18.960
I'm sorry.

503
34:19.480 --> 34:23.280
I really wanted to save that ring for you to use at your wedding.

504
34:25.679 --> 34:26.760
Forget the ring.

505
34:27.800 --> 34:29.120
I don't want anything.

506
34:30.040 --> 34:31.320
I'm worried about you.

507
34:31.960 --> 34:34.600
You give him everything. You surrender everything to him.

508
34:35.800 --> 34:39.199
When you're no longer useful and have nothing left, he'll throw you away.

509
34:41.320 --> 34:42.840
I won't wait to be thrown away.

510
34:44.080 --> 34:45.199
I'm leaving on my own.

511
34:46.880 --> 34:49.800
I want to move out. I want to live with you.

512
34:51.239 --> 34:52.679
Let's move somewhere together.

513
34:58.400 --> 34:59.480
I…

514
35:01.920 --> 35:03.360
I'm not ready yet, Mom.

515
35:09.240 --> 35:12.240
I'm unemployed now. I was just fired.

516
35:16.320 --> 35:18.240
We don't need a fancy new house.

517
35:18.960 --> 35:22.120
We can rent a room. I just want to live with my son. Please.

518
35:25.040 --> 35:26.160
Mom.

519
35:28.280 --> 35:29.560
Give me a little more time.

520
35:31.400 --> 35:33.000
As soon as I find a job,

521
35:34.760 --> 35:36.520
I'll come get you.

522
35:41.400 --> 35:44.440
He must be back. I should go.

523
35:46.600 --> 35:47.960
I'll wait for you.

524
35:56.200 --> 35:57.240
What are you doing here?

525
35:57.840 --> 36:02.040
You were talking big. Didn't you say you'd never set foot in this house again?

526
36:02.120 --> 36:04.720
So now you're eating your words? Pathetic.

527
36:05.360 --> 36:06.880
I don't want to be here.

528
36:07.600 --> 36:09.680
But my mom happens to live here.

529
36:10.280 --> 36:14.120
No job. No money. Nothing to eat.

530
36:14.200 --> 36:16.680
So you came begging your mom for money?

531
36:16.760 --> 36:18.320
Let me tell you something.

532
36:19.760 --> 36:21.160
Your mom has nothing left.

533
36:21.840 --> 36:25.160
I sold every last thing she owned.

534
36:28.040 --> 36:31.840
And as for parasites like you, who are living under my roof,

535
36:32.480 --> 36:35.400
let me make one thing clear,

536
36:35.480 --> 36:38.520
everything your mom owns belongs to me.

537
36:38.600 --> 36:41.960
Even her life and every breath she takes.

538
36:50.080 --> 36:51.640
Remember this.

539
36:53.000 --> 36:54.640
It won't be long

540
36:55.600 --> 36:57.680
before I take my mom out of here.

541
36:58.960 --> 37:03.280
I've been drilling it into her head from morning until bedtime

542
37:03.360 --> 37:05.680
that she owes me everything.

543
37:06.680 --> 37:10.080
Your mom is very well trained.

544
37:12.040 --> 37:15.160
But an ungrateful person like you can't be trained.

545
37:16.120 --> 37:18.880
Get out. Get out of my house. Get out.

546
37:40.760 --> 37:42.000
Where are you going?

547
37:44.800 --> 37:46.720
Home. I finished my work.

548
37:46.800 --> 37:50.000
You can't leave yet. You have to work overtime.

549
37:50.760 --> 37:53.040
There's your pay.

550
37:57.040 --> 38:00.680
I've been working all day, Chayanee. I'm exhausted.

551
38:00.760 --> 38:03.800
I can't keep going. I'll finish it tomorrow.

552
38:05.800 --> 38:07.320
Fine.

553
38:08.560 --> 38:10.280
If you won't do it,

554
38:11.040 --> 38:14.960
I'll call the workers back and make them work until morning.

555
38:18.960 --> 38:19.880
I'll do it.

556
38:21.280 --> 38:24.200
If I come back tomorrow morning

557
38:24.280 --> 38:25.880
and you haven't finished,

558
38:27.120 --> 38:28.920
I'll fire every worker.

559
38:40.800 --> 38:41.720
Chayanee.

560
38:41.800 --> 38:45.560
If you make her work day and night like this,

561
38:45.640 --> 38:47.840
she could die.

562
38:50.000 --> 38:51.320
Good, Mom.

563
38:52.000 --> 38:53.960
Then I won't have to kill her myself.

564
39:10.800 --> 39:12.200
Ramil.

565
39:13.920 --> 39:15.160
Who are you calling?

566
39:21.160 --> 39:22.880
Hathaya isn't going to answer you.

567
39:24.520 --> 39:26.440
Why do you have Hathaya's phone?

568
39:26.520 --> 39:28.880
Hathaya is working.

569
39:29.400 --> 39:33.040
There's a strict rule here. No phones while working.

570
39:33.640 --> 39:35.640
How many hours past working hours is it now?

571
39:36.280 --> 39:38.920
I ordered Hathaya to work overtime all night.

572
39:40.000 --> 39:41.720
You've been fired.

573
39:41.800 --> 39:43.480
You have no right to enter the site.

574
39:44.560 --> 39:46.320
I'll call the police on you.

575
39:49.520 --> 39:52.200
If I find out you snuck into the development,

576
39:52.800 --> 39:54.960
I'll fire every single worker.

577
40:21.880 --> 40:24.080
Hello, Max. Where are you?

578
40:25.360 --> 40:27.400
Chayanee ordered Hathaya to work overtime.

579
40:27.920 --> 40:29.200
Go help her.

580
40:41.160 --> 40:43.240
Let's go help Miss Hathaya.

581
40:43.320 --> 40:46.360
That demon president is vicious and heartless.

582
40:46.440 --> 40:47.400
She can't be human.

583
40:47.480 --> 40:49.600
Some wandering spirit must have possessed her.

584
40:50.240 --> 40:52.720
That's the only reason she could be this hateful. Just wait.

585
40:52.800 --> 40:56.360
If I ever get the chance, I’ll slap the spirit right out of her.

586
40:56.440 --> 40:57.800
Come on. Hurry.

587
41:00.560 --> 41:02.120
Damn, that's bright. Who is it?

588
41:03.600 --> 41:04.680
Chamoi.

589
41:04.760 --> 41:06.840
That's right. It's me.

590
41:06.920 --> 41:08.800
-I'm going to help Miss Hathaya. -No.

591
41:08.880 --> 41:12.040
Your boss ordered Hathaya to work all night.

592
41:12.120 --> 41:13.640
We'll help so she can finish faster.

593
41:13.720 --> 41:16.720
Miss Chayanee ordered Hathaya to work alone.

594
41:17.320 --> 41:18.840
Stop sticking your noses into--

595
41:18.920 --> 41:20.240
Hey!

596
41:20.320 --> 41:22.160
Hey. This is going too far.

597
41:22.240 --> 41:25.000
We'll help for free. We don't even want overtime pay.

598
41:25.080 --> 41:26.520
Move, you wandering spirit.

599
41:26.600 --> 41:27.800
No. I'm not moving.

600
41:29.280 --> 41:31.440
One call to Miss Chayanee

601
41:31.520 --> 41:36.480
and all of you get fired. Then your precious Hathaya will really suffer.

602
41:40.080 --> 41:41.320
Hey.

603
41:41.400 --> 41:44.880
I said no. I'll really call.

604
41:47.400 --> 41:50.760
Well? One little tap

605
41:50.840 --> 41:52.440
and all of you are screwed.

606
41:55.480 --> 41:57.840
Let's go back.

607
41:57.920 --> 41:59.360
Come on.

608
42:01.840 --> 42:05.160
You people have no idea who you're dealing with.

609
42:12.400 --> 42:13.880
Come on.

610
42:13.960 --> 42:15.760
Don't move so slowly.

611
42:15.840 --> 42:18.360
I haven't slept either. I want to go to bed too.

612
42:18.440 --> 42:20.120
But because you're working so slowly,

613
42:20.200 --> 42:22.000
I have to sit here and watch you.

614
42:24.280 --> 42:26.440
If you want me to finish faster,

615
42:26.520 --> 42:28.160
come help me.

616
42:28.240 --> 42:30.360
No way.

617
42:30.440 --> 42:32.960
Madam would kill me.

618
42:34.600 --> 42:36.440
Hurry up. Stop slacking.

619
42:51.680 --> 42:52.920
Grilled chicken.

620
42:57.120 --> 42:59.160
Who's grilling chicken around here?

621
43:22.240 --> 43:23.840
Who's grilling chicken out here?

622
43:25.560 --> 43:29.280
Look left. Look right.

623
43:32.960 --> 43:37.000
No owner? Then it's mine.

624
43:49.880 --> 43:51.440
Hathaya.

625
43:51.520 --> 43:52.600
Hathaya.

626
43:52.680 --> 43:54.920
We came to help. Then we'll finish quickly.

627
43:57.960 --> 44:01.360
Really, it's okay. I can do it. You've all been working all day too.

628
44:02.200 --> 44:03.720
You're more exhausted than we are.

629
44:04.520 --> 44:05.960
Pitching in gets us done fast.

630
44:07.320 --> 44:09.000
Don't worry, Miss Hathaya.

631
44:09.080 --> 44:10.840
That crafty old Chamoi

632
44:10.920 --> 44:13.280
is probably dragging the chicken into the water to eat.

633
44:18.800 --> 44:22.960
I'm not dragging any chicken into the water. I'm not a monitor lizard.

634
44:23.720 --> 44:24.800
How the hell is she here?

635
44:25.800 --> 44:28.240
What? You think I'm stupid?

636
44:29.600 --> 44:33.360
Sorry. I saw through your little trick.

637
44:33.440 --> 44:36.440
I knew you'd find some way to come help your boss.

638
44:37.280 --> 44:38.680
Go home.

639
44:38.760 --> 44:40.760
I'll grill you all the chicken you want.

640
44:40.840 --> 44:42.120
Just don't tell your boss.

641
44:42.720 --> 44:46.160
A hundred. A thousand. I still wouldn't take them.

642
44:46.240 --> 44:48.560
Someone like me

643
44:48.640 --> 44:50.880
would never betray her employer.

644
44:50.960 --> 44:53.640
You're still not leaving?

645
44:53.720 --> 44:55.160
Fine.

646
44:55.240 --> 44:57.320
I'm calling her now.

647
44:58.120 --> 45:00.120
You want to challenge the system? Fine.

648
45:00.200 --> 45:02.080
Please go home.

649
45:02.160 --> 45:03.760
I really can handle this.

650
45:03.840 --> 45:06.400
I'm okay. Go.

651
45:06.480 --> 45:07.600
Well?

652
45:08.520 --> 45:09.880
-Fine. -Auntie.

653
45:10.760 --> 45:13.280
What you said earlier about

654
45:13.360 --> 45:15.240
never betraying your employer.

655
45:15.320 --> 45:17.040
That's actually a really good principle.

656
45:17.120 --> 45:20.240
But with what you're doing right now, let me tell you something.

657
45:20.320 --> 45:22.600
You should choose a good boss.

658
45:22.680 --> 45:24.600
Then maybe your life would get better too.

659
45:26.880 --> 45:29.040
Understand? Choose carefully.

660
45:29.560 --> 45:30.920
You might end up better off.

661
45:34.600 --> 45:36.000
That really hit me.

662
45:36.080 --> 45:38.960
Your boss calls us parasites, right?

663
45:39.040 --> 45:40.240
Yes.

664
45:40.320 --> 45:43.120
Sure. Maybe we are parasites.

665
45:43.880 --> 45:46.880
But someone who works for bad people

666
45:47.680 --> 45:50.080
is just a low-class parasite.

667
45:52.160 --> 45:56.600
That one hurt. Right through the heart.

668
45:59.360 --> 46:00.400
Stop.

669
46:00.480 --> 46:01.960
That's enough.

670
46:02.040 --> 46:05.560
Enough. I can't even process all this guilt fast enough.

671
46:05.640 --> 46:07.480
I'm not here to insult you.

672
46:07.560 --> 46:09.240
Then what do you want?

673
46:09.320 --> 46:11.760
-My chicken. -Hey!

674
46:11.840 --> 46:15.160
My chicken.

675
46:15.720 --> 46:17.600
My grilled chicken.

676
46:17.680 --> 46:19.240
Chicken.

677
46:22.520 --> 46:24.840
Come on. Work faster.

678
46:24.920 --> 46:28.120
I have to sit here watching you.

679
46:29.680 --> 46:31.040
Hurry up.

680
46:34.040 --> 46:35.120
It's okay, Max.

681
46:36.000 --> 46:37.600
You all did everything you could.

682
46:38.280 --> 46:39.880
Tell the workers to go get some rest.

683
46:40.760 --> 46:41.960
And thank everyone for me.

684
47:42.760 --> 47:44.000
Where is Chayanee going?

685
47:58.800 --> 47:59.800
What is she doing here?

686
48:01.720 --> 48:02.720
Did she

687
48:03.760 --> 48:05.000
come to see Hathaya?

688
48:28.400 --> 48:29.320
Chayanee.

689
48:37.760 --> 48:40.600
You've finished your work. So there's nothing left for you to do.

690
48:42.320 --> 48:44.040
I'm done. I'm going home.

691
48:46.640 --> 48:47.880
You don't need to go home.

692
48:48.520 --> 48:50.040
I'll send you back myself.

693
48:50.680 --> 48:53.240
What are you doing? Let go of me.

694
48:53.320 --> 48:56.560
I'm going to do the same thing I did to Grandpa.

695
48:58.400 --> 48:59.480
Miss Chayanee.

696
49:00.080 --> 49:00.960
Don't.

697
49:01.040 --> 49:03.480
No. No. Chayanee, don't.

698
49:03.560 --> 49:05.280
Let me go.

699
49:05.360 --> 49:07.040
Let go. Let go.

700
49:07.120 --> 49:08.960
No. Don't!

701
49:10.280 --> 49:11.080
Hathaya!

702
49:15.800 --> 49:16.920
Ramil.

703
49:20.120 --> 49:21.120
Ramil.

704
49:28.840 --> 49:29.880
Hathaya.

705
50:06.480 --> 50:07.800
I'm sorry.

706
50:09.120 --> 50:10.840
It's okay.

707
50:19.920 --> 50:21.040
What do you want?

708
50:21.120 --> 50:23.440
-Get down on your knees. -You don't have to kneel to anyone.

709
50:23.520 --> 50:25.240
Back off. It's none of your business.

710
50:25.320 --> 50:26.200
‎NEXT EPISODE

711
50:26.280 --> 50:28.600
Where are you going? I told you to put it back.

712
50:28.680 --> 50:29.520
Stop it, Saksit.

713
50:29.600 --> 50:31.040
Why did you do this?

714
50:31.120 --> 50:33.400
-Your father has something-- -I told you already.

715
50:33.480 --> 50:34.640
I don't have a father.

716
50:34.720 --> 50:35.920
My father is dead.

717
50:36.840 --> 50:37.800
You parasite.

718
50:37.880 --> 50:40.320
You think you can stand over me like that?

719
52:34.640 --> 52:36.600
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
